<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="32524675">&lt;p&gt;
    Define the RICEFW objects that need to be developed and assign owners to each.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="externalId" nodeId="2ad15f83"></attribute>
<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="139231f">&lt;p&gt;
    While identifying and defining the necessary RICEFW objects, consider the following:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Does the development component directly address and satisfy a specific requirement or group of requirements?
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Is the component necessary or cost effective in terms of value (e.g., the cost to build versus the output it will
        generate)?
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
